link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (definition-target sentence set)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sentence} \\vdash \\mathrm{Sent}_G \\coloneqq \\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\mid\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)=\\emptyset\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sentence} \\vdash \\mathrm{Sent}_G \\coloneqq \\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\mid\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)=\\emptyset\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> : 系统<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>语言的句子集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>的自由变量集</li>\n<li>句子是没有自由变量的公式</li>\n<li>也称为封闭公式(closed formula)</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-sentence-—-Sentence-$S$","text":"df-sentence — Sentence $S$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","embed":false},{"target